INTERVIEW QUESTION 1
What are the security risks of using AI-generated code from GitHub Copilot?
===========================================================================

Interview Answer:

AI-generated code may contain security vulnerabilities, logical errors,
or outdated coding practices. It can also hallucinate by generating
incorrect APIs or code that does not work as expected.

Therefore, developers should always review, test, and validate
AI-generated code before using it in production.

---

Key Risks

✔ Security Vulnerabilities

✔ Logical Errors

✔ Hallucinations

✔ Outdated Coding Practices

✔ Requires Human Review

Example

AI Suggestion
↓

SQL Query without parameterized statements

↓

Risk

SQL Injection Vulnerability

