INTERVIEW QUESTION 2
What are licensing and attribution concerns when using AI-generated code?
=========================================================================

Interview Answer:

Licensing and attribution concerns arise because AI-generated code may
resemble code from publicly available repositories that have different
software licenses.

Developers should ensure that the generated code does not violate
license terms or copyright requirements. If required by the license,
proper attribution should be provided.

---

Key Points

✔ Check software license

✔ Respect copyright

✔ Verify before reuse

✔ Follow organizational policies

Memory Tip

License First
↓

Then Use

