INTERVIEW QUESTION 4
What are the best practices for using GitHub Copilot responsibly?
=================================================================

Interview Answer:

The best practices for using GitHub Copilot responsibly are:

• Review AI-generated code before using it.

• Test and validate the generated code.

• Check for security vulnerabilities.

• Do not blindly accept AI suggestions.

• Never share confidential information.

• Verify licensing and attribution requirements.

• Use Copilot as a coding assistant, not as a replacement for developer
judgment.

---

Responsible AI Checklist

✔ Review

✔ Test

✔ Validate

✔ Secure

✔ Verify License

✔ Protect Privacy

